  "source_code": "MOD = 998244353\r\n\r\nm = 1\r\nans = []\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    ans.append((n, a))\r\n    if(n > m):\r\n        m = n\r\n    \r\ninv = [0] * (m + 1)\r\nh = [0] * (m + 1)\r\n\r\nif(m >= 1):\r\n    inv[1] = 1\r\n    h[1] = 1\r\n    for i in range(2, m + 1):\r\n        inv[i] = (MOD - MOD // i) * inv[MOD % i] % MOD \r\n        h[i] = (h[i - 1] + inv[i]) % MOD \r\n\r\nfor i, j in ans:\r\n    r = 0\r\n    for k in range(i):\r\n        r = (r + j[k] * (h[k] + h[i - 1 - k])) % MOD\r\n    print(r)",
